B.abq=new A.b7(B.ac2,["Stretching tenure lowers EMI but multiplies interest. A 1% rate cut on a 20-year loan saves more than most people expect \u2014 try it.","SIPs win from consistency, not timing. A 10% annual step-up can nearly double your final corpus.","On an inclusive price never subtract rate% directly \u2014 divide by (1+rate). The reverse tool handles it too.","BMI misses muscle. Combine with Body Fat % (Navy) for a real picture.","CAGR ignores volatility. Check max drawdowns on volatile assets before trusting it.","New regime beats old for most under \u20b916L unless you claim big HRA + 80C + home-loan deductions together.","Always order ~5% extra concrete \u2014 shortfalls mid-pour create cold joints.","Recalculate TDEE every ~5 kg of weight change; plateaus usually mean your target became your maintenance."],t.l)
